What this repository actually contains
--------------------------------------

Only original work by this repository's contributors:

* Machine-configurable launch / stop / status / self-check shell scripts
  for Windows, plus a logon launcher (`autostart-taskboard.pyw`) designed
  to survive the "zombie interpreter registration" failure mode on Windows.
* An optional IMAP/SMTP "mail bridge" that reads replies from a mailbox and
  writes them back into the board (Python standard library only).
* The WorkBuddy skill (`SKILL.md` + `references/`) that drives the install
  and explains the operational details.

